        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: The Paul McCartney Collection\n- Products: McCartney, London Town, Wings Greatest, Flowers in the Dirt\n- People: Paul McCartney\n- Organizations: Wings\n\nFacts:\n- Paul McCartney's The Paul McCartney Collection was split into two halves by release period.\n- The first half of The Paul McCartney Collection comprised albums from McCartney (1970) through London Town (1978).\n- The second half of The Paul McCartney Collection comprised albums from Wings Greatest (1978) through Flowers in the Dirt (1989).\n- Wings released London Town as its sixth studio album in 1978.",
